<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 22.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 22.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Dec 118.00 Jan/Mar 120.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 98.50 Dec 100.00 Jan/Mar 102.50/02.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Dec 99.00 Jan/Mar 101.50/01.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Dec 100.00 Jan 102.50 Jan/Mar 103.00</p>
<p>Avon range Dec 99.00 Jan/Mar 101.50/01.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Jan/Mar 102.00 Apr/Jun 104.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Nov 97.00</p>
<p>Avon range Nov 98.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 98.00</p>
</text>
